    "created_at": "2026-04-29T12:44:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-29T12:46:11Z",
    "body": "> Ping @lilles : this isn't merged yet, but it's depended on by [w3c/csswg-drafts#13675](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/13675) (which I merged without realizing the relevant term didn't actually exist in the public spec, and now have to revert). Any chance of getting this landed?\r\n\r\nI commented in the revert that the anchor-pos PR is supposed to depend on the term in CSSOM View, not the HTML spec.\r\n\r\nBut then, without this PR, that timing is not properly defined?\r\n",
