    "created_at": "2026-11-10T06:32:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-10T06:32:01Z",
    "body": "Hi, is anything still blocking this? We're discussing change notifications for `Element.matchContainer()` in w3c/csswg-drafts#6205, and their timing would depend on this.\r\n\r\nFrom the thread, it looks like [alternative 1](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11613#discussion_r2367903416) is what Chromium [implements](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_frame_view.cc;l=2719;drc=32c60a3d9ea49b9a3d1a2d5ec638441e8468e576) and what @emilio leaned toward. Is what's left the checklist items (second implementer interest, tests, Gecko/WebKit bugs)?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
